doctype html
html(lang="es")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Pug - Motor de Plantilla
    style.
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        background: #f9f5ff;
      }
      .card {
        background: white;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 3rem 4rem;
        text-align: center;
        border: 1px solid #e8d5f5;
        border-top: 6px solid #A44FBF;
        max-width: 520px;
        width: 90%;
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #f3e5ff;
        color: #7a1fa0;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 4px 14px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        color: #A44FBF;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      p.desc {
        color: #888;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      code {
        display: block;
        background: #f8f0ff;
        border: 1px solid #e0c8f5;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
        font-family: monospace;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #6b21a8;
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      a {
        color: #A44FBF;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  body
    .card
      span.badge ⚙️ Motor: #{motor}
      h1 #{mensaje}
      p.desc
        | Este mensaje fue renderizado usando 
        strong Pug
        | , un motor de plantillas con sintaxis limpia basada en indentación.
      code
        | h1 #{mensaje}
      a(href="/") ← Volver al inicio
